+### Ultimate (live display mux)
+
+On laptops whose internal panel can be muxed between the iGPU and the dGPU at runtime, Ultimate
+mode keeps the Hybrid policy (nothing blocked) and moves the internal panel to the dGPU without a
+reboot or logout. It requires a patched `nvidia-modeset` exposing
+`/sys/module/nvidia_modeset/parameters/mux` (and `mux_igpu_brightness`), and an eDP connector on
+both GPUs. `cardwire get` only lists `ultimate` when this is available.
+
+```bash
+cardwire set ultimate
+```
+
+The switch powers the dGPU up, flips the mux, forces connector detection and sends a synthetic
+hotplug uevent (`MUXHOTPLUG=1`, which a udev rule must turn into `HOTPLUG=1`) so the compositor
+lights the panel on the dGPU. If any step fails, or the panel is not lit within 20 seconds, the
+panel is moved back to the iGPU and the previous mode is kept.
+
+The compositor must have the dGPU open: a compositor that started while the dGPU was blocked
+(Integrated/Smart at login) can't use it later, so Ultimate is refused in that session. Start the
+session in Hybrid (or start cardwired only after login) to use Ultimate.
+
+Leaving Ultimate always moves the panel back to the iGPU first. If that fails (for instance when
+the driver hangs, in which case cardwire falls back to `/proc/acpi/call` when available), only
+Hybrid can be selected until the panel is back on the iGPU, so the dGPU is never blocked while it
+drives the panel.
+
+The panel is never switched at early boot: when Ultimate is the saved mode, cardwire starts in
+Hybrid and marks Ultimate as *pending*. Apply it once the graphical session is up (for instance
+from a login autostart entry):
+
+```bash
+cardwire mux apply
+```
+
+Other mux commands:
+
+```bash
+cardwire mux status     # capability, GPU driving the panel, state (idle|switching|pending|degraded), last error
+cardwire mux reconcile  # re-read the mux and reconcile it with the current mode (done automatically after resume)
+```
+
+Before shutdown the panel is moved back to the iGPU (logind delay inhibitor). After resume the mux
+state is reconciled: if the panel came back on the iGPU, Ultimate becomes pending again.
+
 ### Smart Mode
 
 Smart mode blocks the dedicated GPU by default like integrated mode, but uses a real-time analyzer to scan each application at launch and selectively allow GPU access for approved apps.
